    "body": "<!-- claude-projects-attribution: {\"github_login\":\"siainbuletin\"} -->\n_Requested by **Sia**_\n\nBefore: Alacritty's config hard-coded `/usr/bin/fish`, which does not exist on macOS, and there was no plan for other systems.\n\nAfter: `alacritty.toml` imports `shell.toml`, which yadm links from `shell.toml##os.Darwin` (Homebrew fish), `##os.Linux` (`/usr/bin/fish`) or `##os.Windows` (`pwsh`). The link is git-ignored. ADR 0019 holds the cross-platform sketch (detection switches and clone steps for macOS, Linux and Windows/PowerShell).\n\nHow: yadm alternates pick the file by OS name. The Windows route (no yadm, bare clone plus a script) is only sketched, not tried. Run `yadm alt` after pulling.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
